PKG=prngd
NAME=prngd 0.9.29: entropy daemon for systems without /dev/random
ARCH=m68k
VERSION=0.9.29-1
CATEGORY=system
CLASSES=none
VENDOR=Ash Nazag
DESC=Gathers entropy from system commands and serves it (EGD protocol) on TCP localhost:708 for dropbear. Started at boot; seed kept in /opt/amix/etc/prngd-seed. Always give it a socket argument: without one it dumps core.
